{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25917","headline":"老人星 · 赵蕃","name":"老人星","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大史占南极，秋分见寿星。\n增辉延宝历，发曜起祥经。\n灼烁依狼地，昭彰近帝庭。\n高悬方杳杳，孤白乍荧荧。\n应见光新吐，休徵德自形。\n既能符圣柞，从此表遐龄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵蕃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}